// ID: GCI-KQL-BIZ-001
// Title: Sensitive payment workflow changes
// Platform: Microsoft Sentinel (custom ERP/payment audit connector)
 // Type: Business-process audit hunt; sequence correlation recommended
// Data source: PaymentAudit_CL (custom table; schema is illustrative)
// Required fields: TimeGenerated, Action_s, User_s, VendorId_s, BeneficiaryId_s, PaymentId_s, SourceIp_s
// Maturity: Draft — replace table and field names with actual ERP/payment audit schema
// Source: reports/2026/11/22.md
// ATT&CK: No technique assigned; this is fraud-control monitoring, not inherently an intrusion detection.
// False positives: Approved vendor onboarding, bank-detail corrections and finance operations.
// Tuning: Correlate beneficiary/vendor change → approval → payment release; enforce dual control and out-of-band verification.

PaymentAudit_CL
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(7d)
| where Action_s has_any (
    "BeneficiaryChanged", "VendorBankChanged",
    "ApprovalChainChanged", "PaymentReleased"
)
| project TimeGenerated, User_s, Action_s, VendorId_s,
          BeneficiaryId_s, PaymentId_s, SourceIp_s
| order by TimeGenerated desc
